# Treat generated/media fixtures as binary so Git never applies EOL (CRLF)
# conversion to them. Without this, core.autocrlf=true corrupts the byte
# offsets inside small text-based PDFs (xref/startxref), breaking parsing.
*.pdf   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
